CM_ SG_ 129 DC_CloseContactorsRequest "Request to close DC contactors (i.e. request to start power transfer)";
CM_ SG_ 129 PrechargeReady "Indicator that cable check has successfully passed and we are ready to start precharging (valid only in case of smart DC charging)";
CM_ SG_ 129 SocketLockState "Current socket state";
CM_ SG_ 129 ErrorCode "Internal M2IEV or EVCC error code";
CM_ SG_ 130 PP_State "Current proximity state";
CM_ SG_ 130 CP_State "Current control pilot state";
