CM_ SG_ 260 TemperatureDC2LowFault "Temperature on DC- terminal <=-30 degC";
CM_ SG_ 260 TemperatureACFault "Temperature on AC terminals is too high";
CM_ SG_ 260 EmergencyStopFault "Emergency stop";
